==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
As with all stages in this subchapter, Ark of the Month isn't very difficult. A simple lineup that could clear [[Peptide Snowfield]] is all that is really necessary here.

